ath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T08:00:40-07:00","id":1443595,"title":"","content":"Ugh, ministry. Asking who could be and who couldn't be a ministry member is a moot point, they don't actually have standards, that's their founding principle. It's an always viable yet very weak option. On the otherhand talk about the Church of Set... The Cat-God Bast would be an Aeon of Ra and not to be used. If we were to to talk about a Follower of Set... she could probably make it. <br /> She's very much more Protean 2 than Serpentis. She's weirdly flexible and that might be an argument for serpentis 3, and she's a stunner so that's sepentis 1, and she licks a lot of things so... hmm. You sure we haven't got a city gangrel? <br /> <br /> Potence 3, Celerity 3, Presence 4, Obfuscate 3, Animalism 1, Auspex 2, Protean 2... something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-15T17:36:02-07:00","id":1444104,"title":"","content":"Lets see things that seem obvious to me for catwoman.<br /> <br /> Presence... she's definately a seductrice<br /> <br /> Animalism- I'd say that's a natch there<br /> <br /> lets see who gets those inclan and has a nickname involving cats....<br /> <br /> Lets see... if we make her an Ahrimane.<br /> <br /> Spiritus is a fun discipline and does let you get a Batman Returns type catwoman...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachm