ass=\"message\">It is, and its a piss poor explanation for the agility and stamina that batman, cat-woman and most non-powered heroes display. Low levels of Potence, however, does an exceptional job at justifying such feats.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think &quot;needs half a dozen disciplines&quot; is a piss poor setup for discplines. If there is a base by in for &quot;everyone needs this many points of Physical disciplines to play&quot; then they are no long clan features and should be handed out to everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-17T10:02:13-07:00","id":1444346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443157-gotham-city-by-night-a-k-a-to-the-bat-cave?p=1444344#post1444344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think &quot;needs half a dozen disciplines&quot; is a piss poor setup for discplines. If there is a base by in for &quot;everyone needs this many points of Physical disciplines to play&quot; then they are no long clan features and should be handed out to everyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, while parkor is impressive, the canonical Catwoman DOESN'T have superpowers. So clearly most of what she has is just Athletics and Dexterity anyway.<br />"